-top margin-medium"><div class="button-group"><a href="#available-spaces" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="light-purple-btn-for-dark-bg" class="button-content w-variant-2e4536c8-bb5a-c158-9563-a4d9fc7fb4a2"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">Availalble  Spaces</div><div class="button-material-icon">token</div></div></div></div></a><a href="/our-building/rental-inquiry-form" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="light-purple-btn-for-dark-bg" class="button-content w-variant-2e4536c8-bb5a-c158-9563-a4d9fc7fb4a2"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">Rental Inquiry Form</div><div class="button-material-icon">token</div></div></div></div></a><a href="#rent-terms" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="light-purple-btn-for-dark-bg" class="button-content w-variant-2e4536c8-bb5a-c158-9563-a4d9fc7fb4a2"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">Terms and Conditions</div><div class="button-material-icon">token</div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header_hero_background_rent-image-wrapper"><div class="image_rent_hero-overlay-layer"></div><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0e800868017b73bb79_Auditorium_Dancing.jpg" alt="" class="header_background_rent_hero-image"/></div></header></section><section class="section_stats8 background-color-orange-light-gradient"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="stats8_component"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxlarge"><div><h2>Gather. Connect. Celebrate</h2></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid stats8_list"><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Vibrant</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">historic building in the lively Mission District.</h3></div><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Affordable</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">for every group. Ask about discounts for nonprofits.</h3></div><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Flexible</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">1 to 230 people, 15 min. to days, daytime or night.</h3></div><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Equipment</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">rentals for meetings or celebrations.</h3></div><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Accessible</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">and located close to public transportation.</h3></div><div class="stats8_item"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="heading-style-h4">Extras</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 text-weight-medium">included like WiFi, chairs, tables and easels.</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="available-spaces" class="section_layout423"><div class="component-instructions-delete-2 hide"><div class="container-small"><div class="component-instructions-callout"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="text-weight-semibold">Important:<br/></div></div><div>If you rename this component, remember to update the classes in the HTML embed named <span class="rl-styleguide_label-8">layout423_hover-content</span>. Background colors for cards are controlled by selecting the card element and editing via the Interactions tab.<br/></div><img width="200" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67be2e31db5c9bd39d1dffb9_CleanShot%202023-08-23%20at%2015.07.21%402x.png" class="component-instructions-image"/></div></div></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="layout423_component"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxlarge"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="text-style-tagline">Host Your Event in a Space That Reflects Our Community’s Spirit</div></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Available Spaces</h2></div><p class="text-size-medium">From intimate meetings to vibrant celebrations, The Women’s Building offers beautiful, flexible spaces filled with light, character, and history—perfect for your next gathering.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid layout423_grid-list"><div class="layout423_row"><a data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b08ff1" href="#auditorium" class="layout423_card-2 text-color-white w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-_6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b08ff2-4ea73958" class="layout423_image-wrapper"><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b08ff3" class="layout423_overlay"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0ee4f40bc1b5edc249_Auditorium-V.3-02-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0ee4f40bc1b5edc249_Auditorium-V.3-02-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0ee4f40bc1b5edc249_Auditorium-V.3-02-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0ee4f40bc1b5edc249_Auditorium-V.3-02.jpg 1200w" alt="The Women’s Building auditorium configured with rows of chairs facing a podium, ideal for presentations or lectures." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b0ee4f40bc1b5edc249_Auditorium-V.3-02.jpg" loading="lazy" class="layout423_image"/></div><div class="layout423_card-content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="text-style-tagline text-color-white">Spacious, Striking, and Versatile</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">The Auditorium<br/></h3><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b08ffc" class="layout423_card-content-bottom"><div class="margin-top margin-small"><p>With exposed brick, high ceilings, and a 2,700 sq. ft. open floor plan, this room is ideal for large events like fundraisers, community celebrations, and conferences.</p></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button is-link text-color-white"><div>View Space</div><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg></div></div></div></div></div></a><a data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09005" href="#audre-lorde" class="layout423_card-2 text-color-white w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-_6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09006-4ea73958" class="layout423_image-wrapper"><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09007" class="layout423_overlay"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b10e8e6fce565bca55b_Audre-Lorde-03-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b10e8e6fce565bca55b_Audre-Lorde-03.jpg 800w" alt="Side view of Audre Lorde Room arranged in lecture-style with chairs facing a presentation table." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b10e8e6fce565bca55b_Audre-Lorde-03.jpg" loading="lazy" class="layout423_image"/></div><div class="layout423_card-content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="text-style-tagline text-color-white">Bright, Elegant, and Welcoming</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Audre Lorde Room<br/></h3><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09010" class="layout423_card-content-bottom"><div class="margin-top margin-small"><p>A stunning 1,500 sq. ft. room featuring arched windows and natural light, perfect for workshops, celebrations, and milestone moments.</p></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button is-link text-color-white"><div>View Space</div><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg></div></div></div></div></div></a><a data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09019" href="#room-a" class="layout423_card-2 text-color-white w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-_6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b0901a-4ea73958" class="layout423_image-wrapper"><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b0901b" class="layout423_overlay"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02.jpg 800w" alt="Empty Room A with large arched windows and hardwood floor, ready for various setups." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02.jpg" loading="lazy" class="layout423_image"/></div><div class="layout423_card-content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxsmall"><div class="text-style-tagline text-color-white">Intimate, Flexible, and Full of Light</div></div><h3 class="heading-style-h4">Room A<br/></h3><div data-w-id="6f81b076-5563-1d89-c6e7-3b5eb4b09024" class="layout423_card-content-bottom"><div class="margin-top margin-small"><p>At 446 sq. ft., this cozy space is great for classes, meetings, or as a breakout room—ideal for smaller groups or quiet focus.</p></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button is-link text-color-white"><div>View Space</div><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-embed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="CurrentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg></div></div></div></div></div></a><div class="layout423_hover-content w-embed w-script"><style>
.layout423_card-content {
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.3s; /* Apply a transition to opacity changes */
}

/* Styling for the card content when it's inactive */
.layout423_card-content.inactive {
    opacity: 0;
}

</style>

<script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js"></script>
<script>
$(document).ready(function() {
    // Check if the screen width is above a certain threshold (e.g., 768px)
    if (window.innerWidth >= 992) {
        $(".layout423_card").hover(function() {
            // When a card is hovered over
            $(".layout423_card-content").not($(this).find(".layout423_card-content")).addClass("inactive");
        }, function() {
            // When the mouse leaves a card
            $(".layout423_card-content").removeClass("inactive");
        });
    }
});
</script></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><header class="section_header23 background-color-purple-dark text-color-white"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small"><div class="header23_component"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h4">Let&#x27;s Start Planning!</h2></div><p class="text-size-regular">Have any Questions?<br/>Please contact Adriana Peralta, Bookings Coordinator<br/>at <a href="#" class="text-link-color-mindaro">adriana@womensbuilding.org</a> or <a href="tel:14154311180" class="text-link-color-mindaro">415 431-1180</a> ext 21 or fax 415 861-8969<br/><br/>If you already have a booking, log into the Rental Client Portal <a href="https://womensbuilding.org/room-rentals/rental-client-portal/" class="text-link-color-mindaro">here</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section id="auditorium" class="section_room_auditorium background-color-teal-light-gradient"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small"><div class="room_component"><div class="w-layout-grid room_content-grid"><div class="room_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Auditorium</h2></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><p class="text-size-medium">This 2700 sq. ft. room has a high acoustic ceiling and architectural details like a wood floor and exposed bricks. Rental includes 16 rectangular (2.5ft x 6ft) tables and 220 chairs.</p></div><div class="layout16_item-list"><div id="w-node-_0e54a2cc-5038-587b-b8fd-c6d67d9460e8-4ea73958" class="layout16_item"><div class="icon-twb-wrapper-navigation-bullet"><div class="icon-twb-primary-wrapper"><div class="code-embed w-embed"><svg width="currentWidth" height="currentHeight" viewBox="0 0 300 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
