</svg></div></div></div><div class="layout16_item-text-wrapper"><p>Breakout room to complement the Audre Lorde Room</p></div></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-group"><a href="/our-building/rental-inquiry-form" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="main---dark-purple-btn-for-light-bg" class="button-content"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">Rental Inquiry Form</div><div class="button-material-icon">token</div></div></div></div></a><a href="#rent-terms" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="main---dark-purple-btn-for-light-bg" class="button-content"><div data-wf--button-layout--layout="normal" class="button-layout"><div class="button-text">Terms and Conditions</div><div class="button-material-icon">token</div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_04fdfbca-bf56-b9a3-04f6-233d80116590-4ea73958" class="room_image-wrapper"><div class="room_gallery_component"><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="gallery13_slider w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="gallery13_mask w-slider-mask"><div class="gallery13_slide w-slide"><div class="room_gallery_image-wrapper"><img sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02.jpg 800w" alt="Empty Room A with large arched windows and hardwood floor, ready for various setups." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b1766a4f5227f584105_Room-A-02.jpg" loading="lazy" class="gallery13_image"/></div></div><div class="gallery13_slide w-slide"><div class="room_gallery_image-wrapper"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b17ead66dfd1a180551_Room-A-01-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b17ead66dfd1a180551_Room-A-01.jpg 800w" alt="Interior of Room A with tables and chairs arranged for a meeting or group activity." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b17ead66dfd1a180551_Room-A-01.jpg" loading="lazy" class="gallery13_image"/></div></div><div class="gallery13_slide w-slide"><div class="room_gallery_image-wrapper"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b13321384f4f3790283_Room-A_Layout_horizontal1-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b13321384f4f3790283_Room-A_Layout_horizontal1-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b13321384f4f3790283_Room-A_Layout_horizontal1.png 989w" alt="Alternative floor plan of Room A with different table and chair arrangement in horizontal layout." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67f69b13321384f4f3790283_Room-A_Layout_horizontal1.png" loading="lazy" class="gallery13_image"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery13_arrow hide-mobile-landscape w-slider-arrow-left"><div class="gallery13_arrow-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
