</svg></div></div><div class="gallery13_slide-nav w-slider-nav w-round"></div></div></div></div><div class="room_content"><div class="w-richtext"><h3>Capacity, 446 square feet</h3><p>‍</p><p><strong>Theater (ONLY chairs)<br/></strong>40 capacity</p><p>‍</p><p><strong>Classroom (Tables and chairs)<br/></strong>24 capacity</p><p>‍</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_04fdfbca-bf56-b9a3-04f6-233d801165ad-4ea73958" class="room_content"><div class="w-richtext"><h3>Rates</h3><p>‍</p><p><strong>Weekdays before 5pm</strong></p><p><strong>‍</strong>$50 per hour.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="rent-terms" class="section_rent_terms"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="rent_terms_component"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xxlarge"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><div class="text-style-tagline">Everything You Need for a Seamless Event</div></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">Space Terms and Conditions</h2></div><p class="text-size-medium">From setup to sound, The Women’s Building offers flexible rental terms, equipment packages, and support services to help your gathering go smoothly—so you can focus on what matters most: connecting with your community.</p></div></div></div><div data-duration-in="400" data-duration-out="200" data-current="Things to Remember" data-easing="ease" class="rent_terms_tabs w-tabs"><div id="w-node-_49cb9b1a-b464-2239-9c88-1a3c48f8877d-4ea73958" class="rent_terms_tabs-menu w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Things to Remember" class="rent_terms_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Things to Remember</h3></a><a data-w-tab="Equipment Rental" class="rent_terms_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Equipment Rental</h3></a><a data-w-tab="Additional Services" class="rent_terms_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Additional Services</h3></a><a data-w-tab="Payment Details" class="rent_terms_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Payment Details</h3></a><a data-w-tab="Cancelation and Change" class="rent_terms_tab-link tabs-last w-inline-block w-tab-link"><h3 class="heading-style-h6">Cancelation and Change</h3></a></div><div class="rent_terms_tabs-content w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Things to Remember" class="layout507_tab-pane w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="rent_terms_card is-text-only"><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Make sure that your rental time includes time to set-up and break down your event. The room will be empty upon your arrival and should be left in the same condition.</li><li>All renters of meeting and event rooms need to provide proof of general liability insurance and have The Women’s Building listed as an additional insured. Exemptions to this policy will be reviewed on a case by case basis.</li><li>You may serve wine and beer. <strong>NO hard alcohol is allowed.</strong> An <a href="http://www.abc.ca.gov/FORMS/ABC221I.pdf" target="_blank" class="text-link-color-katy-berry">ABC License</a> may be required.</li><li>Latest time for your event, including 1 hour clean-up at end of reservation time:<ul role="list"><li>10 PM Friday through Sunday, if reservation ends at 11 PM.</li><li>9 PM on Mondays through Thursdays, if reservation ends at 10 PM.</li></ul></li></ul><h6>Please contact our Bookings Coordinator for pricing and more details.</h6></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Equipment Rental" class="layout507_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="rent_terms_card is-reversed-mobile"><div id="w-node-_8b390360-f19d-837e-4d7a-4fb5a46eb1f4-4ea73958" class="w-richtext"><h4>General Information</h4><ul role="list"><li>All rates are per day</li><li>We bring, install and pack up our projector and P.A. equipment</li><li>You must install and pack up the stage with staff instruction</li><li>Our Sound Equipment requires a Sound Technician to set up, operate and remove the equipment. Please ask our Bookings Coordinator for more information</li><li>Discount packages are available. See below</li></ul><h4>Stage</h4><ul role="list"><li>One Panel= 6×3 ft. | $25 per panel</li><li>Full Stage (9 panels) 9×18 ft. | $200</li></ul><h4>Sound System</h4><ul role="list"><li>Requires you to hire our approved Sound Technician</li><li>$200 plus $15 per microphone</li></ul><h4>Spot Lights</h4><ul role="list"><li>We do not have a mixing console</li><li>$10 each (19˚, 30˚, 40˚ spots)</li></ul><h4>Digital Multimedia Player</h4><ul role="list"><li>$60</li></ul><h4>5ft. Moveable Tripod Screen</h4><ul role="list"><li>$20</li></ul><h4>Portable Audio System</h4><ul role="list"><li>Includes ONE microphone, $15 per additional microphone. Maximum: 3 microphones.</li><li>$60</li></ul><h4>Discount Packages</h4><ul role="list"><li>Stage &amp; Sound System $300 (includes 5 Microphones)</li><li>Multimedia $120<ul role="list"><li>Multimedia Projector</li><li>Portable Audio System (PA)</li><li>1 Microphone</li><li>5 ft. movable tripod Screen</li></ul></li></ul><h6>Please contact our Bookings Coordinator for pricing and more details.</h6></div><div class="div-block-2"><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="gallery25_slider w-slider" data-autoplay="true" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="gallery25_mask w-slider-mask"><div class="gallery25_slide w-slide"><a href="#" class="gallery25_image-wrapper w-inline-block w-lightbox"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67ed2ace65e9017eaf37e11c_6ftx2ft%20rectangular%20tables.png" alt="" class="gallery25_image"/><div>6ftx2ft rectangular tables</div><script type="application/json" class="w-json">{
