<path d="M12.6893 7.25L6.96967 1.53033L8.03033 0.469666L15.5607 8L8.03033 15.5303L6.96967 14.4697L12.6893 8.75H0.5V7.25H12.6893Z" fill="currentColor"/>
</svg></div></div><div class="gallery25_slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Additional Services" class="layout507_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="rent_terms_card is-text-only"><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Set-up and break down of chairs and tables.</li><li>Cleaning Service: May be required for some events.</li><li>Event Assistant: May be required for some events.</li><li>Sound Technician: Required when renting our sound system.</li></ul><h6>Please contact our Bookings Coordinator for pricing and more details.</h6></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Payment Details" class="layout507_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="rent_terms_card is-text-only"><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>When you sign the event space contract, you will need to pay a <strong>Refundable Security Deposit</strong>.</li><li>The <strong>Refundable Security Deposit</strong> amount is based on event details, and other fees may apply.</li><li><strong>Full payment</strong> for the event is due 30 days before the date of your event.</li></ul><h6>Please contact our Bookings Coordinator for pricing and more details.</h6></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Cancelation and Change" class="layout507_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="rent_terms_card is-text-only"><div class="w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li><strong>With MORE than 30 day notice</strong> – $100 Reservation Fee.</li><li><strong>Between 7 and 30 days</strong> – 50% of room reservation cost + $100 Reservation Fee.</li><li><strong>Less than one week </strong>– Full charge for reservation.</li><li><strong>No Show </strong>– Full charge for reservation</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_cta55"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small"><div class="cta55_component"><div class="cta55_card"><div class="cta55_card-content"><div class="max-width-large"><div class="max-width-large align-center"><div class="text-align-center"><div class="margin-bottom margin-small"><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Are You a Nonprofit Looking for Space?</h2></div><p class="text-size-medium">We love partnering with mission aligned organizations. If you&#x27;re a nonprofit looking to host ameeting, event, or workshop, we invite you to rent one of our beautiful, affordable rooms. <br/>‍<br/>Reach out to Adriana Peralta, Bookings Coordinator<br/>at <a href="#" class="text-link-color-jelly-berry">adriana@womensbuilding.org</a> or <a href="tel:14154311180" class="text-link-color-jelly-berry">415 431-1180</a> ext 21 or fax 415 861-8969<br/><br/>If you already have a booking, log into the Rental Client Portal <a href="https://womensbuilding.org/room-rentals/rental-client-portal/" class="text-link-color-jelly-berry">here</a>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="cta55_background-video-wrapper background-color-mindaro"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--subscribe-to-newsletter--variant="orange-background" class="subscribe-_section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-small"><div class="cta8_component"><div class="cta8_content"><div class="max-width-large justify-right"><div class="subscribe-heading-wraper"><div class="subscribe-image-wraper"><div class="padding-medium padding-right"><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6736312b16f98ac1069dc2a6/67b3b11f529a72a36c21fcca_Subscribe%20Image.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="subscribe-image"/></div></div></div><h2 class="heading-style-h5">Be in the Know — Subscribe for the Latest from The Women’s Building! </h2></div></div><div class="subscription_button_content"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1GIEMENYWfpdSgMETldZppF24ukSbyscTQpOJ46-nS9o/edit" target="_blank" class="w-inline-block"><div data-wf--button-wrap--size="medium" class="button-wrap"><div data-wf--button-style--style="dark-btn-for-orange-background" class=